  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xqFLPSDF/Untitled-design-1.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Превратите свою игру в идеальное RPG с помощью Skyro</strong></h3><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Skyro заменяет всю оригинальную музыку на идеальную атмосферу из Skyrim</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Вновь ощутите знакомую ностальгию в Minecraft</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>ПРЕДВАРИТЕЛЬНЫЙ ПРОСМОТР:</strong></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z3JKFVSqX3c?wmode=transparent\" height=\"378\" width=\"378\"></iframe></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>МОИ ДРУГИЕ ПРОЕКТЫ</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.ibb.co/gZbFxYdC/echoes-banner.png&amp;;n=-1\" alt=\"Ham E\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/horror-ambience-music\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/horror-ambience-music</a>&nbsp;</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/datapack/horror-ambience-music-echoes\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/datapack/horror-ambience-music-echoes</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://i.ibb.co/Gfn9P4J0/tunes-banner.png&amp;;n=-1\" alt=\"HAM FT\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/horror-ambience-music-forgotten-tunes\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/horror-ambience-music-forgotten-tunes</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/horror-ambience-music-2-forgotten-tunes\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/horror-ambience-music-2-forgotten-tunes</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0jm08hxq/Untitled-design-2.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-music-remastered-streamer-friendly\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/minecraft-music-remastered-streamer-friendly</a></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/music-remastered-mmr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/music-remastered-mmr</strong></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h1><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>СПОНСОР</strong></h1><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0Mxx23C/Sponsor.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"900\" height=\"316\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">Получите скидку 15% на первый месяц использования Kinetic Hosting по ссылке<strong>&nbs